{
  "activity": "ExcelProcessScopeX",
  "package": "UiPath.Excel.Activities",
  "coded": [
    {
      "call": "excel.ExcelProcessScope",
      "scope": "using",
      "init": {
        "param": "options",
        "type": "ScopeOptions",
        "props": {
          "DisplayAllerts": "{DisplayAlerts}",
          "ExistingProcessAction": "UiPath.Excel.ExistingExcelProcessAction.{ExistingProcessAction}",
          "FileConflictResolution": "UiPath.Excel.ExcelFileConflictResolution.{FileConflictResolution}",
          "LaunchMethod": "UiPath.Excel.ExcelStartMethod.{LaunchMethod}",
          "LaunchTimeout": "{LaunchTimeout}",
          "MacroSetting": "UiPath.Excel.MacroSetting.{MacroSettings}",
          "ProcessMode": "UiPath.Excel.ExcelProcessMode.{ProcessMode}",
          "ShowExcelWindow": "{ShowExcelWindow}"
        }
      },
      "usings": ["UiPath.Excel", "UiPath.Excel.Activities.API", "UiPath.Excel.Activities.API.Models"]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "using (var ExcelProcessScopeTag = excel.ExcelProcessScope(new ScopeOptions { ... })) { 子 }。ScopeOptions のプロパティ名は DisplayAllerts（API の綴りのまま）と MacroSetting（アクティビティは MacroSettings）。中の Use Excel File は UseOptions.ExcelProcess にこの変数を渡す（ExcelApplicationCard.json の {@IExcelProcess}）。サンプルと build はまだ（AUT-1065 の担当が確かめる）"
}
